B.abY=new A.l([B.y,"1200 Shards. Pulls 1\u201310: 20%, 22%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%, 50%, 60%, 75%, 100%. Resets whenever you summon a god, including duplicates. Guaranteed by pull 10.",B.l,"1200 Shards. Pull 1\u201310: 20%, 22%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%, 50%, 60%, 75%, 100%. Si azzera quando ottieni una divinit\xe0, anche duplicata. Garantita entro la decima.",B.k,"1200 Shards. Tiradas 1\u201310: 20%, 22%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%, 50%, 60%, 75%, 100%. Se reinicia al obtener un dios, incluso duplicado. Garantizado en la d\xe9cima.",B.i,"1200\u30b7\u30e3\u30fc\u30c9\u30021\uff5e10\u56de\u76ee: 20%, 22%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%, 50%, 60%, 75%, 100%\u3002\u795e\u3092\u7372\u5f97\u3059\u308b\u3068\u91cd\u8907\u3067\u3082\u30ea\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u300210\u56de\u4ee5\u5185\u306b\u78ba\u5b9a\u3002",B.h,"1200 \uc0e4\ub4dc. 1\u201310\ud68c: 20%, 22%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%, 50%, 60%, 75%, 100%. \uc911\ubcf5 \ud3ec\ud568 \uc2e0 \ud68d\ub4dd \uc2dc \ucd08\uae30\ud654. 10\ud68c \uc774\ub0b4 \ud655\uc815.",B.f,"1200\u788e\u7247\u3002\u7b2c1\u201310\u62bd\uff1a20%\u300122%\u300125%\u300130%\u300135%\u300140%\u300150%\u300160%\u300175%\u3001100%\u3002\u83b7\u5f97\u795e\u660e\u5373\u91cd\u7f6e\uff0c\u5305\u62ec\u91cd\u590d\u3002\u7b2c10\u62bd\u5fc5\u5f97\u3002",B.j,"1200 Shards. Ziehungen 1\u201310: 20%, 22%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%, 50%, 60%, 75%, 100%. Neustart bei jedem Gott, auch Duplikaten. Sp\xe4testens Ziehung 10 garantiert."],t.N)
